tools in a single instrument with an automated switching mechanism."},"website":"https://symphera.io/"},{"slug":"audavis","name":"AUDAVIS","sector":"Digital tech","location":"Munich","logo":"audavis.png","description":"Develops AI-assisted financial auditing software. Its Artificial Auditor helps audit teams analyze transactions and check the quality of financial data.","round":{"amount":"Over €1.1M","stage":"Seed","date":"2025-01-15","source":"https://www.htgf.de/en/audavis-seed-htgf/"},"fit":{"points":{"germany":20,"sector":25,"tech_depth":14,"stage":15,"no_funding":0},"rationale":"AI-assisted transaction checks are a clear digital tech use case. The announcement gives limited detail on how the AI is differentiated."},"website":"https://www.audavis.ai/"},{"slug":"auxilius","name":"Auxilius","sector":"Digital tech","location":"Unterföhring · Munich area","logo":"auxilius.png","description":"Builds software for enterprise governance, risk, and compliance. It turns policies into rules that run automatically and produce evidence for internal monitoring and audits.","round":{"amount":"About €1.3M","stage":"Pre-seed","date":"2026-07-07","source":"https://www.htgf.de/en/auxilius-raises-pre-seed/"},"fit":{"points":{"germany":20,"sector":25,"tech_depth":20,"stage":15,"no_funding":0},"rationale":"Executable controls are a concrete technical approach to automating enterprise compliance."},"website":"https://www.auxilius.ai/"},{"slug":"lytra","name":"lytra","sector":"Industrial tech","location":"Munich","logo":"lytra.svg","description":"Builds AI software for the after-sales service teams of machinery manufacturers. It automates service requests and helps operators find product and process knowledge.","round":{"amount":null,"stage":"Pre-seed","date":"2026-01-15","source":"https://www.htgf.de/en/lytra-pre-seed-financing/"},"fit":{"points":{"germany":20,"sector":25,"tech_depth":16,"stage":15,"no_funding":0},"rationale":"Factory pilots support the industrial use case. The announcement describes early product evidence with limited detail on the underlying AI."},"website":"https://www.lytra.ai/"},{"slug":"zentio","name":"Zentio","sector":"Industrial tech","location":"Berlin","logo":"zentio.png","description":"Builds production planning software for manufacturers. It brings together machine and operations data so factories can adjust schedules as conditions change.","round":{"amount":"€1.4M","stage":"Pre-seed","date":"2025-12-11","source":"https://www.htgf.de/en/zentio-pre-seed/"},"fit":{"points":{"germany":15,"sector":25,"tech_depth":19,"stage":15,"no_funding":0},"rationale":"The platform combines machine data, mathematical optimization and automation for real-time production planning."},"website":"https://www.zentio.io/"},{"slug":"ionkraft","name":"IonKraft","sector":"Climate & industrial tech","location":"Aachen","logo":"ionkraft.png","description":"Develops plasma coatings for plastic packaging. The coatings provide a barrier for protecting packaged goods while making the packaging easier to recycle.","round":{"amount":"€3.5M","stage":"First equity round","date":"2024-11-18","source":"https://www.htgf.de/en/htgf-ionkraft-seed/"},"fit":{"points":{"germany":15,"sector":25,"tech_depth":24,"stage":15,"no_funding":0},"rationale":"The RWTH spin-off builds plasma-coating machinery. The first equity round and planned launch support early-stage fit."},"website":"https://ionkraft.com/"},{"slug":"mo-re","name":"mo:re","sector":"Life sciences","location":"Hamburg","logo":"mo-re.jpg","description":"Builds lab equipment and software to automate 3D cell culture experiments. Its platform helps research teams run and analyze studies on cell models for animal-free drug development.","round":{"amount":"€2.3M","stage":"Seed","date":"2025-03-26","source":"https://www.htgf.de/en/htgf-seed-more/"},"fit":{"points":{"germany":15,"sector":25,"tech_depth":22,"stage":15,"no_funding":0},"rationale":"Dedicated lab hardware automates several steps in 3D cell culture, with software to standardize experiments."},"website":"https://more.science/"},{"slug":"heidelberg-epignostix","name":"Heidelberg Epignostix","sector":"Life sciences","location":"Heidelberg","logo":"heidelberg-epignostix.png","description":"Develops software to classify tumors from DNA methylation patterns. Its first product focuses on distinguishing brain tumor subtypes that are difficult to tell apart with standard methods.","round":{"amount":"€4.3M","stage":"Seed","date":"2024-07-02","source":"https://www.htgf.de/en/htgf-seed-heidelberg-epignostix/"},"fit":{"points":{"germany":15,"sector":25,"tech_depth":25,"stage":15,"no_funding":0},"rationale":"The tumor classifier builds on a decade of research into how DNA methylation patterns distinguish cancer subtypes."},"website":"https://epignostix.com/"}]